---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import SiteHeader from "../../components/SiteHeader.astro";
import SiteFooter from "../../components/SiteFooter.astro";
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Riftbound Versus · Pocket Powered"
  description="Take the battlefield in Riftbound Versus. Play cards, answer your opponent, and fight for eight points in your desktop browser. An independent project by Pocket Powered."
  image="/riftboundvs/arena.png"
  themeColor="#07121d"
>
  <SiteHeader />
  <main>
    <section class="rift-hero">
      <div class="shell hero-copy">
        <a class="back" href="/#work">← All projects</a>
        <p class="eyebrow">Pocket Powered / Riftbound Versus</p>
        <h1>Take the battlefield.<br /><em>Make your next move.</em></h1>
        <p class="lede">Play your hand. Challenge your opponent. Fight for eight points in a game of Riftbound, right in your browser.</p>
        <div class="actions">
          <a class="button button--yellow" href="https://riftboundvs.com">Play Riftbound Versus <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
          <a class="text-link" href="#inside">See how a match unfolds ↓</a>
        </div>
        <p class="availability">Live beta · Best on desktop · Practice against a bot or play a friend</p>
      </div>
      <figure class="arena shell">
        <a href="/riftboundvs/arena.png" aria-label="Open full game board screenshot">
          <img src="/riftboundvs/arena.png" width="1280" height="720" alt="A Riftbound Versus match showing battlefields, cards in hand, and an opponent choosing where to deploy a unit" fetchpriority="high" />
        </a>
        <figcaption>A real match in progress: the opponent chooses where to deploy a unit.</figcaption>
      </figure>
    </section>

    <section class="intro shell" id="inside">
      <p class="eyebrow">At the table</p>
      <h2>Your turn is only<br />part of the story.</h2>
      <div class="features">
        <div><span>01 / Commit</span><h3>Put your hand to work.</h3><p>Spend your rune resources to play units and spells. Decide what to commit now and what to save for the next exchange.</p></div>
        <div><span>02 / Contest</span><h3>Fight for the battlefield.</h3><p>Move units out of your base and into contested ground. Conquer and hold battlefields to work toward eight points.</p></div>
        <div><span>03 / Respond</span><h3>Have an answer ready.</h3><p>A spell or showdown can open the door to a response. Choose your moment, pick your targets, and follow the chain as effects resolve.</p></div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="match-tour shell" aria-labelledby="tour-title" id="match-tour" data-focus="battlefields">
      <p class="eyebrow">Inside the match</p>
      <h2 id="tour-title">Read the board.<br />Find your opening.</h2>
      <p class="tour-lede">Explore the parts of the table that shape each decision.</p>
      <div class="match-controls" role="group" aria-label="Explore the game board">
        <button type="button" data-view="battlefields" aria-pressed="true" aria-controls="match-explanation">01 · Battlefields</button>
        <button type="button" data-view="hand" aria-pressed="false" aria-controls="match-explanation">02 · Your hand</button>
        <button type="button" data-view="reactions" aria-pressed="false" aria-controls="match-explanation">03 · Reactions &amp; history</button>
      </div>
      <div class="board-detail">
        <img src="/riftboundvs/arena.png" width="1280" height="720" alt="Match screenshot with the selected part of the game board highlighted" loading="lazy" />
        <div class="board-highlight" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="match-explanation" id="match-explanation" aria-live="polite">
        <div data-explanation="battlefields"><h3>Where the points are won.</h3><p>Abandoned Hall sits unclaimed in this match. Choosing where to send a unit changes which battlefield you can pressure—and what your opponent has to defend.</p></div>
        <div data-explanation="hand" hidden><h3>Your options, always in reach.</h3><p>The hand stays at the edge of the table. Here, units sit alongside Gust: a choice between developing your board and keeping a spell for a useful moment.</p></div>
        <div data-explanation="reactions" hidden><h3>See what is happening, and why.</h3><p>The reaction chain shows the pending choice. The action ledger records the opponent’s draw and channeled runes, making the sequence of a turn easier to follow.</p></div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="play-modes shell" aria-labelledby="play-title">
      <div><p class="eyebrow">One more match</p><h2 id="play-title">Try a line.<br />Then try it on a friend.</h2></div>
      <div class="mode-copy">
        <h3>Practice against a bot</h3><p>Start with a community deck and get straight to the table. Try different plays and get familiar with the rhythm of a match.</p>
        <h3>Challenge a friend</h3><p>Share the battlefield in an online match. Play your cards, respond to theirs, and see whose plan survives contact.</p>
        <a class="button button--yellow" href="https://riftboundvs.com">Start a match <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <aside class="between-matches shell" aria-labelledby="between-title">
      <div><p class="eyebrow">Between matches</p><h2 id="between-title">Bring a different plan.</h2><p>The card library and deck builder are there when you want to refine your next game.</p></div>
      <div class="support-links"><a class="text-link" href="https://riftboundvs.com/deckbuilder">Build a deck ↗</a><a class="text-link" href="https://riftboundvs.com/cards">Explore the cards ↗</a></div>
    </aside>

    <section class="craft shell">
      <p class="eyebrow">Designed, built, and shipped</p>
      <h2>Making the rules<br />feel like a game.</h2>
      <p>I built the shared game engine, the browser table, and the multiplayer infrastructure behind Riftbound Versus. The goal is to keep attention on the next decision, while the game handles turn flow, legal actions, and resolving effects.</p>
      <div class="stack"><span>Kotlin game engine</span><span>React + TypeScript</span><span>Live multiplayer</span></div>
    </section>
    <section class="closing shell">
      <h2>Your next move?</h2>
      <a class="button button--yellow" href="https://riftboundvs.com">Take it to the table <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
      <p>Riftbound Versus is an independent fan project, not affiliated with or endorsed by Riot Games. Riftbound, League of Legends, and their associated artwork belong to their respective owners.</p>
    </section>
  </main>
  <SiteFooter />
</BaseLayout>
<script is:inline src="/riftboundvs/match-tour.js" defer></script>
<style>
main {
  background: #07121d;
  color: #f7f1df;
}
.rift-hero {
  padding: 24px 0 56px;
  background: radial-gradient(ellipse at 65% 35%, #183c48 0, transparent 65%);
}
.back {
  color: #b4c3ca;
  text-decoration: none;
  font-size: 0.85rem;
}
.hero-copy {
  text-align: center;
}
.back {
  display: block;
  text-align: left;
  margin-bottom: 28px;
}
.eyebrow {
  color: #d4bd7b;
  font-size: 0.72rem;
  letter-spacing: 0.17em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  font-weight: 700;
}
h1 {
  font:
    400 clamp(3rem, 6vw, 5.4rem)/1.03 Georgia,
    serif;
  letter-spacing: -0.045em;
  margin: 24px 0;
}
h1 em {
  color: #d4bd7b;
  font-weight: 400;
}
.lede {
  font-size: 1.2rem;
  max-width: 540px;
  margin: 0 auto;
  color: #bccbd1;
}
.actions {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  gap: 28px;
  margin: 30px 0 18px;
}
.text-link {
  color: #d4bd7b;
  text-underline-offset: 5px;
}
.availability {
  color: #8fa4ae;
  font-size: 0.78rem;
}
.arena {
  margin-top: 48px;
  margin-inline: auto;
}
.arena img {
  height: auto;
  border: 1px solid #d4bd7b66;
  box-shadow: 0 30px 80px #0008;
  border-radius: 14px;
}
figure {
  margin: 0;
}
figcaption {
  color: #93a9b4;
  font-size: 0.8rem;
  margin-top: 14px;
  text-align: center;
}
.intro {
  padding-block: 92px;
}
.intro h2,
h2 {
  font:
    400 clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3.4rem)/1.12 Georgia,
    serif;
  letter-spacing: -0.035em;
  margin: 16px 0 24px;
}
.features {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
  gap: 40px;
  margin-top: 44px;
}
.features > div {
  border-top: 1px solid #d4bd7b44;
  padding-top: 22px;
}
.features span {
  color: #d4bd7b;
  font-size: 0.75rem;
}
.features h3 {
  font:
    400 1.55rem Georgia,
    serif;
}
.features p,
.craft > p:not(.eyebrow),
.tour-lede {
  color: #b3c3cc;
  line-height: 1.75;
}

.craft {
  padding-block: 72px;
  border-top: 1px solid #ffffff18;
}
.craft > p:not(.eyebrow) {
  max-width: 740px;
  font-size: 1.1rem;
}
.stack {
  display: flex;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  gap: 10px;
  margin-top: 28px;
}
.stack span {
  font-size: 0.8rem;
  border: 1px solid #d4bd7b44;
  color: #d4bd7b;
  border-radius: 30px;
  padding: 6px 14px;
}
.closing {
  text-align: center;
  padding: 64px 0 80px;
}
.closing > p {
  font-size: 0.75rem;
  color: #839ba7;
  max-width: 670px;
  margin: 40px auto 0;
}
@media (max-width: 700px) {
  .actions {
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 20px;
  }
  .back {
    margin-bottom: 36px;
  }
  .rift-hero {
    padding-bottom: 36px;
  }
  .arena {
    margin-top: 32px;
  }
  .intro,
  .craft {
    padding-block: 48px;
  }
  .features,
  .play-modes,
  .between-matches {
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 24px;
  }
  .features {
    gap: 28px;
  }
  .match-tour,
  .play-modes {
    padding-block: 40px;
  }
  .closing {
    padding-block: 36px 56px;
  }
  h1 {
    font-size: 3.4rem;
  }
  .lede {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
  }
  .arena img {
    border-radius: 8px;
  }
}
@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
  :global(html) {
    scroll-behavior: auto;
  }
}

.match-tour,
.play-modes,
.between-matches {
  padding-block: 64px;
  border-top: 1px solid #ffffff18;
}
.match-controls {
  display: flex;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  gap: 10px;
  margin: 28px 0 20px;
}
.match-controls button {
  cursor: pointer;
  font: inherit;
  font-size: 0.85rem;
  border: 1px solid #d4bd7b66;
  background: #ffffff05;
  color: #d4bd7b;
  border-radius: 8px;
  padding: 12px 18px;
  min-height: 44px;
}
.match-controls button[aria-pressed="true"] {
  color: #07121d;
  background: #d4bd7b;
}
.board-detail {
  position: relative;
  overflow: hidden;
  border-radius: 12px;
  border: 1px solid #d4bd7b66;
}
.board-detail img {
  width: 100%;
  height: auto;
}
.board-highlight {
  position: absolute;
  border: 3px solid #ffe09a;
  border-radius: 8px;
  box-shadow: 0 0 0 1600px #07121d70;
  pointer-events: none;
}
[data-focus="battlefields"] .board-highlight {
  left: 15%;
  top: 32%;
  width: 32%;
  height: 26%;
}
[data-focus="hand"] .board-highlight {
  left: 16%;
  top: 74%;
  width: 36%;
  height: 25%;
}
[data-focus="reactions"] .board-highlight {
  left: 72%;
  top: 1%;
  width: 27%;
  height: 70%;
}
.match-explanation {
  padding: 24px 28px;
  border: 1px solid #d4bd7b44;
  border-top: 0;
  border-radius: 0 0 12px 12px;
  min-height: 160px;
  background: #ffffff04;
}
.match-explanation h3,
.mode-copy h3 {
  font:
    400 1.6rem Georgia,
    serif;
  margin: 0 0 12px;
}
.match-explanation p,
.mode-copy p,
.between-matches p {
  color: #b3c3cc;
  line-height: 1.75;
  max-width: 75ch;
  margin: 0;
}
.play-modes {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
  gap: 64px;
  margin-top: 40px;
}
.mode-copy p {
  margin-bottom: 28px;
}
.between-matches {
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 32px;
}
.between-matches h2 {
  font-size: 2rem;
}
.support-links {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 16px;
  flex-shrink: 0;
}
@media (max-width: 700px) {
  .play-modes {
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 20px;
  }
  .between-matches {
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: flex-start;
  }
  .match-explanation {
    padding: 20px;
    min-height: 230px;
  }
  .match-controls button {
    flex: 1;
    padding: 10px;
  }
}
</style>
